This is a '''list of diplomatic missions in Balisca'''. At present, 2xx&nbsp;nations maintain [[W:Diplomatic mission|diplomatic missions]] to the [[Balisca|Baliscan Confederation]] in the capital, [[Castejón]]. 

Only diplomatic missions operated by a foreign country are listed here. Honorary consulates, typically private offices designated to provide limited services on behalf of a foreign country, are not listed.

== Embassies in Castejón ==
{{Main|List of diplomatic missions in Castejón}}
The following 185 countries maintain embassies in [[Castejón]] as their primary [[W:Diplomatic mission|diplomatic missions]] to Balisca. Entries marked with an asterisk (*) have [[W:Chancery (diplomacy)|chanceries]] (embassy buildings) located on or near a portion of the [[Tistaina Canal]] known as [[Canyón de Embaixada]] ("Embassy Canyon").

